    "detailed_description": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/29d02ecab5dc2d4672850b24b9098de8.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=363 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/29d02ecab5dc2d4672850b24b9098de8.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>In an underground location, there is a secret research facility. <br>During the process of researching biotechnology to advance human evolution, a pink life form was accidentally created. <br>As a lab report of groundbreaking progress in research, the researchers named the life form 'PCP-Singularity'.<br>Without thinking if the life form has self-awareness, the researchers subjected it to various irrational experiments. <br>The life form has been through a series of stimuli, so its instinct of surviving and reproduction has been strongly activated. <br>It morph into a terrified form, taking revenge on the researchers for what they did, and escaping from the reserch facility!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/44b9e781c76afe36edc33bb5ed9bac71.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=362 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/44b9e781c76afe36edc33bb5ed9bac71.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The target is utilizing the evolved abilities to seek revenge on the researchers while progressively breaking through barriers toward the exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/5644fd1d7b84ae3101184abb389326b0.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=362 height=197 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/5644fd1d7b84ae3101184abb389326b0.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Evolving abilities through successive attacks on researchers, such as double jumping, air-dashing, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/4e162740cef3fa0a8990705c3d162e36.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=476 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/4e162740cef3fa0a8990705c3d162e36.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>There are exquisite 2D animations. Different types of female characters, and various positions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.mp4?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/29d02ecab5dc2d4672850b24b9098de8.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=363 height=199 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/29d02ecab5dc2d4672850b24b9098de8.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>In an underground location, there is a secret research facility. <br>During the process of researching biotechnology to advance human evolution, a pink life form was accidentally created. <br>As a lab report of groundbreaking progress in research, the researchers named the life form 'PCP-Singularity'.<br>Without thinking if the life form has self-awareness, the researchers subjected it to various irrational experiments. <br>The life form has been through a series of stimuli, so its instinct of surviving and reproduction has been strongly activated. <br>It morph into a terrified form, taking revenge on the researchers for what they did, and escaping from the reserch facility!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/44b9e781c76afe36edc33bb5ed9bac71.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=362 height=196 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/44b9e781c76afe36edc33bb5ed9bac71.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>The target is utilizing the evolved abilities to seek revenge on the researchers while progressively breaking through barriers toward the exit.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/5644fd1d7b84ae3101184abb389326b0.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=362 height=197 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/5644fd1d7b84ae3101184abb389326b0.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>Evolving abilities through successive attacks on researchers, such as double jumping, air-dashing, and more.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/4e162740cef3fa0a8990705c3d162e36.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=476 height=175 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/4e162740cef3fa0a8990705c3d162e36.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span><br>There are exquisite 2D animations. Different types of female characters, and various positions.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.poster.avif?t=1754452779\" width=600 height=336 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.webm?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2688650/extras/1e2c3421ec6701c565bb7703eb34b13d.mp4?t=1754452779\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>",
